<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Yun Gwan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1111</span> · <a href="/centuries/12th-century">12th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Yun Gwan was a Korean general and statesman of the Goryeo period. After defeats by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jurchens">Jurchen</a> he created the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byeolmuban">Byeolmuban</a>, a special army, in 1104. In 1107 he led it into the north-east, defeated the Jurchen and built nine fortresses, but they proved hard to hold and were returned to the Jurchen in 1109.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/yun-gwan.jpg" alt="Yun Gwan" width="320" height="589" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:General_Yun_Kwan_1.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
